<title>GERMANY: Fresenius Medical details 96 results.</title>
<headline>Fresenius Medical details 96 results.</headline>
<dateline>OBERURSEL, Germany 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of US dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,501   vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   88	vs n/a</p>
<p>    Earnings per share			 1.16    vs n/a dollars</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German medical technology group is Fresenius Medical Care. It was created on October 1, 1996.</p>
<p>The group also released the following &quot;proforma&quot; figures to illustrate results for the year as a whole presuming it had been in operation for that entire year.</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,053   vs 2,847</p>
<p>    Sales in core dialysis products	2,765   up 10 pct</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   44	vs 71</p>
<p>The group however said that its net profit would be 78 million dollars for 1996 if extraordinaries totalling 34 million dollars, earmarked for risk provisions outside the U.S., were eliminated.</p>
<p>    Group earnings per shares		1.03    vs n/a dollars</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
